Description: fast classic single-workspace desktop layer for GNOME
 Gnozzard keeps GNOME's system indicators but adds a permanent solid
 bottom panel, one ungrouped button per window, a tall Applications menu,
 pinned apps, Show Desktop, desktop shortcuts and a Resources launcher.
 .
 It also provides native AppImage launching and Nautilus context actions, and
 bundles the Resources system monitor. Common GTK, Electron/Chromium, X11,
 Wayland, audio and FUSE runtime libraries are installed as package
 dependencies.
